:: Sister Desk Coffee [micro_event event nobr] {"position":"1800,2900","size":"100,100"}
/* Desk visitor (micro event 21, "Desk visitors" in Define Events): she brings me a coffee because she wants something,
   this time to sit in on the next client call. Shown in the CMD drawer, so no action is spent and there is no exit link.
   The third choice needs her at 40 corruption: she pays a "deposit", but only after checking who can see us. */
<p>$sister.callName puts one of the coffees down on my desk, right on top of the page I was reading, and keeps the other one pressed to her chest like a hostage.</p>
<<Media "images/characters/sister/activities/bringing_coffee_0.mp4" 300>>
<<silently>>
<<set _msgs to [
	{ who: $sister, text: "Before you say no..." },
	{ who: $player, text: "I haven't said anything yet." },
	{ who: $sister, text: "You're making the no face. You do a thing with your left eyebrow, you've done it since you were about eight." },
	{ text: "I put my eyebrow back where it belongs. She takes that as permission." },
	{ who: $sister, text: "I'd like to sit in on the next client call. I won't say a word, I just want to see how you actually handle these people." },
	{ who: $player, text: "How come? I thought you had plenty to do out there." },
	{ who: $sister, text: "I've watched $darius.name build spreadsheets for two weeks and I still couldn't tell you what he actually does. Besides, I brought you coffee, so you're more or less obligated now." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>
<br>
<div id="desk-coffee-choice">
	<div>
		<<link "Let her sit in">>
			<<replace "#desk-coffee-choice">>
				<<silently>>
				<<set _msgs to [
					{ who: $player, text: "Fine. You sit in the corner and you don't laugh at anybody's tie." },
					{ who: $sister, text: "Deal. I've seen some of the ties on those video calls, so I can't promise anything, but I'll be good." },
					{ text: "She lets go of the second coffee too, which I'm fairly sure was never part of the plan, and walks back to her desk looking extremely pleased with herself." },
				]>>
				<</silently>>
				<<Chat _msgs>>
				<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterRelation" 2>>
			<</replace>>
		<</link>>
	</div>
	<div>
		<<link "Make her earn it">>
			<<replace "#desk-coffee-choice">>
				<<silently>>
				<<set _msgs to [
					{ who: $player, text: "You can sit in if you take the minutes. Everything anybody says, typed up and in my inbox the same day." },
					{ who: $sister, text: "That's not sitting in, that's homework." },
					{ who: $player, text: "Welcome to the job. Oh, and next time the coffee is black." },
					{ who: $sister, text: "You've taken three sugars since you were twelve." },
					{ who: $player, text: "Not at work I don't." },
					{ text: "She snorts, takes a sip of my coffee to make a point, makes a face at how sweet it is, and puts it back down in front of me." },
					{ who: $sister, text: "Fine, you'll get your minutes. In Comic Sans." },
				]>>
				<</silently>>
				<<Chat _msgs>>
				<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterRelation" 1>>
			<</replace>>
		<</link>>
	</div>
	<<if setup.corruptionTotal("sister") >= 40>>
		<div>
			<<link "Ask what else is in it for me">>
				<<replace "#desk-coffee-choice">>
					<<silently>>
					<<set _msgs to [
						{ who: $player, text: "And what do I get out of it, apart from the coffee?" },
						{ text: "She has a comeback ready, I can see it on her face, and then she doesn't use it. Instead she glances over her shoulder at the office, at $darius.name's back and $brian.name's headphones, the way people look both ways before they cross against a red light." },
						{ text: "She leans down as if she wants to point at something on my screen and kisses me at the corner of my mouth. It's quick, and it's very deliberate." },
						{ who: $sister, text: "Consider that a deposit." },
						{ who: $player, text: "And the rest?" },
						{ who: $sister, text: "Depends on how the call goes, doesn't it?" },
					]>>
					<</silently>>
					<<Chat _msgs>>
					<p>She walks back to her desk without looking back once, which seems to take more effort than walking normally. When she sits down, she pulls her hair over the side of her face that's turned toward me.</p>
					<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterLust" 3>>
					<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterCorruption" 1>>
				<</replace>>
			<</link>>
		</div>
	<</if>>
</div>
